        "damage_taken": {
          "max": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "block": "<15,-2,15>",
        "is": "obsidian"
      }
    ]
  },
  "solution_ticks": 350,
  "notes": [
    "A deterministic short log trunk avoids generated-tree height variance. The enderman has normal AI; night and clear weather avoid sunlight/rain teleportation. The judge checks no player damage and latches any observed enderman health loss; it cannot directly measure the player gaze."
  ]
